#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:8
msgid "配置应用与增加 I/O"
msgstr "Configure an application and add I/O"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:10
msgid ""
"应用只维护一份 schema-2 `assembly.toml`。它选择 Board、后端、时钟、组件、实例及 预算；SoC／Board JSON "
"维护硬件事实，生成的 `resolved.json` 用于检查结果。"
msgstr ""
"An application maintains one schema-2 `assembly.toml`. It selects the Board,"
" backend, clock, components, instances and budgets. SoC/Board JSON maintains"
" hardware facts; the generated `resolved.json` exposes the result for "
"inspection."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:13
msgid "先查询，再填写"
msgstr "Query before authoring"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:15
msgid "以启明 V3.1 的 UART 为例，设置 `NEXUS_SOURCE` 为当前平台路径，再查询："
msgstr ""
"For the Qiming V3.1 UART, set `NEXUS_SOURCE` to the current platform path, "
"then query:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:22
msgid ""
"`console` 是应用自定的逻辑名字，`uart1` 是 Board 提供的 binding，USART1 是实际 "
"控制器。查询给出候选模式、资源、来源和限制；后端、时钟及全部实例仍须一起校验。"
msgstr ""
"`console` is an application-defined logical name, `uart1` is a Board "
"binding, and USART1 is the physical controller. The query reports candidate "
"modes, resources, sources and limits. The backend, clock and all instances "
"still require validation together."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:25
msgid "已有工程从对应模板修改 `assembly.toml`。没有配置时，可创建一份独立 UART 配置："
msgstr ""
"For an existing project, edit the `assembly.toml` from its matching "
"template. If no configuration exists, create an independent UART "
"configuration:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:34
msgid ""
"`init` 拒绝覆盖已有文件。`empty`、`gpio`、`uart` 是有限起始配置，不自动增加任务、 调度器或产品恢复策略。先阅读生成的 "
"TOML，再采用其中的容量和优先级。"
msgstr ""
"`init` refuses to overwrite an existing file. `empty`, `gpio` and `uart` are"
" bounded starting configurations; they do not add tasks, a scheduler or "
"product recovery policy. Read the generated TOML before adopting its "
"capacities and priorities."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:37
msgid "检查有效配置"
msgstr "Check the effective configuration"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:46
msgid ""
"`mode = \"irq\"` 与 `rx.format = \"events\"` 对应查询中的 `irq-byte-event`。 "
"`rx.capacity = 32` 表示 32 个事件，不是 32 字节。`explain` 显示最终接口、引脚、 "
"时钟、IRQ／DMA、内存域、容量和执行责任；编辑器 schema 仅提供字段提示。"
msgstr ""
"`mode = \"irq\"` and `rx.format = \"events\"` correspond to `irq-byte-event`"
" in the query. `rx.capacity = 32` means 32 events, not 32 bytes. `explain` "
"reports final interfaces, pins, clocks, IRQ/DMA, memory domains, capacities "
"and execution responsibilities. The editor schema provides field hints only."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:50
msgid "修改后可比较两份有效配置："
msgstr "After a change, compare two valid configurations:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:57
msgid ""
"两份输入都须有效。重点看 factory ID、公开接口、传输、执行和存储变化。调整实例 顺序可能改变紧凑 ID，不将它们持久化后跨 bundle "
"使用。"
msgstr ""
"Both inputs must be valid. Inspect changes to factory IDs, public "
"interfaces, transfer, execution and storage. Reordering instances may change"
" compact IDs; do not persist them for use across bundles."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:60
msgid "使用所选接口"
msgstr "Use the selected interface"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:62
msgid ""
"生成 bundle 自带 `nexus_factory_strong.h`。`uart.console` 使用 "
"`nx_factory_uart_ref(NX_UART_REF_CONSOLE)`；获取只返回既有静态对象，不启动硬件。 先成功启动 "
"Platform，再按该模式提供 service、请求与缓冲存储。"
msgstr ""
"The generated bundle includes `nexus_factory_strong.h`. For `uart.console`, "
"use `nx_factory_uart_ref(NX_UART_REF_CONSOLE)`. Acquisition returns an "
"existing static object; it does not start hardware. Start Platform "
"successfully before supplying the service, request and buffer storage "
"required by the selected mode."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:66
msgid ""
"只选择的类别才有 factory getter。可选组合用 `defined(NX_FACTORY_HAS_UART)` 判断 "
"是否存在；`factory.strong` 不是配置字段。`factory.capabilities` 只选择独立能力元数据。"
msgstr ""
"Only selected categories have factory getters. For optional combinations, "
"use `defined(NX_FACTORY_HAS_UART)` to test their presence. `factory.strong` "
"is not a configuration field. `factory.capabilities` selects only separate "
"capability metadata."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/app-configuration.md:69
msgid ""
"Native 配置查询需显式 `--test-support`。私有 Board 使用 `--board-package` 创建， 其相对路径随 "
"TOML／产品目录移动。完整字段和单位见 [TOML 参考](../reference/configuration/assembly.md)，执行规则见"
" [I/O 执行](io-execution.md)，错误定位见[排错](troubleshooting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Native configuration queries require explicit `--test-support`. Use "
"`--board-package` when creating a private Board configuration; its relative "
"path moves with the TOML/product directory. See the [TOML "
"reference](../reference/configuration/assembly.md) for all fields and units,"
" [I/O execution](io-execution.md) for execution rules, and "
"[troubleshooting](troubleshooting.md) for diagnostics."

msgid ""
"对照实际镜像与报告"
msgstr ""
"Compare the actual image and reports"

msgid ""
"从同一完整源码读取自己的装配与已有报告，替换下面的真实文件路径："
msgstr ""
"Read your assembly and existing reports from the same complete source "
"checkout, replacing the paths below with actual files:"

msgid ""
"`--evidence` 可重复指定，读取既有 `elf_resource_budget` 或 `build_provenance`， "
"不生成新测试或 HIL 结果。查询重新核对实际文件、配置、后端／模式、输入及产物； 报告自称 `passed` "
"不足以建立匹配。资源报告未记录生产源码身份时， `identities.source = \"not_recorded\"`，总状态与相应验证仍为 "
"`not_assessed`。"
msgstr ""
"Repeat `--evidence` to read existing `elf_resource_budget` or "
"`build_provenance` reports; it generates no new tests or HIL results. "
"The query rechecks actual files, configuration, backend/modes, inputs "
"and artifacts. A report claiming `passed` is insufficient to establish a"
" match. When a resource report has no production source identity, "
"`identities.source = \"not_recorded\"`; its overall status and "
"corresponding validation remain `not_assessed`."

msgid ""
"通过既有 verifier 的 provenance 还须匹配当前源码和实际 ELF 配置，才报告 "
"`identity_matched`；它只表示身份对应，`software_qualified` 仍为 `false`，不证明 "
"模型执行、实时行为或物理 HIL。陈旧、不匹配或未知报告保留 `not_assessed` 和 "
"`reason`。必须读取各维身份与状态，不能把查询命令成功等同于报告通过。"
msgstr ""
"Provenance admitted by the existing verifier must also match current "
"source and the actual ELF configuration before reporting "
"`identity_matched`. This means only that identities correspond; "
"`software_qualified` remains `false` and proves no model execution, "
"real-time behavior or physical HIL. Stale, mismatched and unknown "
"reports retain `not_assessed` with a `reason`. Read each identity "
"dimension and status; a successful query command does not mean that its "
"reports passed."
